      "content": "The Galata Bridge (Turkish: \"Galata Köprüsü\" , ] ) is a bridge that spans the Golden Horn in Istanbul, Turkey. From the end of the 19th century in particular, the bridge has featured in Turkish literature, theater, poetry and novels.",
